// Statistical reporting: quarterly/annual transmissions (D. 848-1/2),
// L. 846-3 information (D. 848-3), publication (D. 848-4), joint
// arrêtés (D. 848-5), L. 846-2 information (R. 848-1).
//
// «Avant la fin de chaque trimestre, la CNAF et la CCMSA
// transmettent aux services statistiques ... des données agrégées
// ... portant sur le trimestre précédent» 1°..5° (D. 848-1): duty
// D10 (emitter owes the stats service); the five items arrive as
// retained content facts, completeness as an institutional
// conjunction; timeliness is derived (transmission before the end of
// the current quarter, i.e. within six months of the reference
// quarter start; Q4 data through April, i.e. within seven months,
// on the retained Q4 marker; the ordinary branch needs a positive
// non-Q4 classification, unknown stays undetermined (PA-R4-02).
// The duty maintains the
// timely-and-complete transmission (PA-M8).
// D10 direction - bearer the emitter, beneficiary the stats service.
// «Avant la fin du mois d'avril de chaque année ... portant sur
// l'année précédente» 1°..5° (D. 848-2): duty D11, same shape; the
// April due date arrives retained (year-to-date arithmetic beyond
// core 0.2), timeliness is derived against it (PA-M8).
// «Les informations mentionnées à l'article L. 846-3 sont
// transmises aux services statistiques» (D. 848-3): duty D12.
// «Les services statistiques ... ainsi que la CNAF, la CCMSA et
// [Pôle emploi / France Travail] assurent la publication régulière
// des résultats» (D. 848-4, operator switch 2024-07-01): literal
// head (publication has no counterparty); the undertaking attaches
// to the named actors by law (two windowed rules), never inferred
// from a publication event (PA-M9); actual publication is a
// separate performance marker.
// «Les listes ... sont fixées par des arrêtés conjoints» (D. 848-5):
// retained arrêté existence maps to applicable lists; list contents
// are unpinned (no silent invention).
// «Les informations mentionnées à l'article L. 846-2 sont
// transmises aux services statistiques» (R. 848-1): duty D14.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.css.prime_activite version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:ppa";

